blocks.explanation:
CRUD yani Create, Read, Update aur Delete; database ke bunyadi kaam.

1. Create: SQL INSERT se table mein naya record. Misal: INSERT INTO students (ID, Name, Age) VALUES (2, 'Amna', 17);

2. Read: SQL SELECT se data nikalna aur dikhana; stored data nahin badalta. Misal: SELECT * FROM students;

3. Update: shart ke saath SQL UPDATE se maujooda record badalna, jab durusti chahiye. Misal: UPDATE students SET Age = 18 WHERE ID = 2;

4. Delete: shart ke saath SQL DELETE se ghair zaroori record hatana; ehtiyat ahem data bachati hai. Misal: DELETE FROM students WHERE ID = 2;

Kyun: yeh operations database ka data sambhalte aur maloomat durust aur taaza rakhte hain, is liye har database application in par munhasir hai. Python yeh SQL commands bhej kar karta hai.
